# A showcase for the ICE REFLECTION (bead inc-qh0w, commit 2). The player
# carries a lit torch and stands in the middle of a 5x5 room whose walls are
# ICE, with a doorway to the south. The torch lights the ice on every side, so
# the reflection pass makes the walls glint blue as the player moves.
#
#   tools/headless.sh tools/keys/ice-room.keys 1
#   ./incursion -load save/Varag.sav      # after ESC b saves it
#
# Idiom, proven by tools/keys/lightfilter-show.keys and hide-carried-light.keys:
#   w y            first wizard invocation: open the menu and enable wizard mode
#   <letter>       pick a menu option; 'e' = Item Acquisition, 'K' = Change
#                  terrain type (option index 36 -> the 11th capital letter)
#   w <letter>     reopen the menu (already enabled, no 'y') and pick again
# The targeting cursor starts on the player and will NOT cross a solid cell, so
# every wall is reached through the still-open interior and the corners go down
# before the edges that would later block the path to them.
#
# Terrain letters from the "Which terrain type?" list: [h] Ice Wall.

@include chargen-mage.keys
@dump:arrival

SPACE

# A lit torch on the character, FIRST. 'w y' enables wizard mode and opens the
# menu; 'e' is Item Acquisition; RIGHT*37 selects the torch; SPACE swaps it
# into the Light Source slot. The acquisition leaves the equipment screen open,
# so ESC returns to the map before any terrain goes down -- without it every
# following key navigates the equipment list instead of the wizard menu.
w y e RIGHT*37 ENTER
SPACE
ESC
@dump:torch-acquired

# --- the ice room, corners first, then edges, doorway omitted at south-centre.
# Wizard mode is already on, so each placement is 'w K': open the menu, pick
# Change-terrain (K), move the cursor from the player, ENTER the cell, 'h' Ice.
# corners
w K RIGHT UP RIGHT UP ENTER h
w K LEFT UP LEFT UP ENTER h
w K RIGHT DOWN RIGHT DOWN ENTER h
w K LEFT DOWN LEFT DOWN ENTER h
# north edge
w K UP UP ENTER h
w K RIGHT UP UP ENTER h
w K LEFT UP UP ENTER h
# south edge (centre left open as the doorway)
w K RIGHT DOWN DOWN ENTER h
w K LEFT DOWN DOWN ENTER h
# east edge
w K RIGHT RIGHT ENTER h
w K RIGHT UP RIGHT ENTER h
w K RIGHT DOWN RIGHT ENTER h
# west edge
w K LEFT LEFT ENTER h
w K LEFT UP LEFT ENTER h
w K LEFT DOWN LEFT ENTER h

@dump:ice-room-built

# Save the showcase to save/Varag.sav and quit.
ESC b
@dump:showcase-saved

@quit
